  "notes": [
    "This corpus ships whole. No 身份证号 and no 手机号 appears in it, and no 住址 carries an address; what the gate reports are role words used in the abstract. The 法定代表人 it counted 75 times carries a name 15 times, and the 住所地 it counted 16 times is mostly a rule about which procuratorate has jurisdiction. See the gate block in this manifest.",
    "51 case titles name a party in full, exactly as the SPP printed them (检例第20号 马世龙…). That is the citation, not a party list this corpus assembled, and it is why this is a case index rather than an anonymised one.",
    "案号, 法院, 审理程序, 当事人, 案由 and 裁判日期 are empty because the SPP publishes none of them as a field. 法律依据 is not: 【相关规定】 lists the statutes the SPP itself cites, and it is filled for 229 of 250 records.",
    "案件类型 is derived from which branch of law 【相关规定】 cites, not published. It is empty where a case cites more than one branch: (未识别) 53, 刑事 123, 民事 34, 行政 40.",
    "The 【…】 labels are not stable across the years: 第二批 (2016) writes 【诉讼过程】 and 【相关立法】 where 第三十三批 onward writes 【检察机关履职过程】 and 【相关规定】, and 第一批 has neither of the last two. Both spellings map to one canonical section, so 相关规定 is not silently empty for 2016 to 2021.",
    "公开日期 is the date on the batch notice, which is when the SPP published the case; 裁判日期 stays empty because the SPP dates the batch, not the case.",
    "Several cases share one batch page, so 原始链接 carries the 检例 number as a fragment. convert keys a document by that column and no URL here has a docId=, so the bare page address made every case on it one document -- 250 rows became 60. page_url in the JSON holds the address without it."
  ],
